#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開かない…
#. 鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The door won't budge. It must be locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、入る訳にはいかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Obviously I can't go in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここには、入れないみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I can't get in there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは霧切さんの部屋だ。
#. 今は、特に用はないかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
